2. Complete Dockerfile

Since the question specifically says openjdk:17-jdk-slim and /app:

If application is JAR

FROM openjdk:17-jdk-slim
WORKDIR /app
COPY target/apartment-management.jar /app/apartment-management.jar
EXPOSE 8080
CMD ["java", "-jar", "apartment-management.jar"]

If application is WAR

If the question allows WAR but specifically says to use OpenJDK, the application must have an appropriate server/runtime setup. For a straightforward exam answer, use the JAR version above when the question gives apartment-management.jar.

